---
import { bittalking } from '../data/lab';
---

<article class="lab-feature">
  <div class="lab-copy">
    <p class="mono-meta lab-kicker"><span class="live-dot"></span> From the lab · 实验室正在做</p>
    <h2>让交流，<br />自然<span class="about-marker">靠近。</span></h2>
    <p class="lab-name">BitTalking <span>消息 / 群聊 / 音视频通话</span></p>
    <p class="lab-description">{bittalking.description} 从一句消息到一次面对面的交流，欢迎来了解，也欢迎把体验和建议告诉我们。</p>
    <div class="lab-actions">
      <a class="solid-link" href="/projects/bittalking/">认识 BitTalking <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a class="uline" href={bittalking.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">访问官网 ↗</a>
    </div>
    <p class="lab-footnote">邀请体验中 · 下载与平台开放情况请见官网</p>
  </div>
  <div class="lab-art" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="lab-orbit"></span>
    <span class="lab-art-label">A LITTLE CLOSER</span>
    <div class="lab-bubble bubble-one"><span class="bubble-dot"></span> 一句消息</div>
    <div class="lab-bubble bubble-two">一次面对面的交流 <span>↗</span></div>
    <div class="lab-symbol">B<span>·</span></div>
    <div class="lab-channels"><span>消息</span><span>语音</span><span>视频</span></div>
  </div>
</article>
